Oyun Çeviri is a separate, newly written program (Python / Kotlin / JavaScript). It uses, unmodified, the native
Remote Play library of CouchSubs (vendor/couchsubs_native.dll):

    CouchSubs - Copyright (C) 2026 Sinan Yorulmaz
    https://github.com/yorulmazsinan/couchsubs  (GNU AGPL-3.0)
    Source of the library: windows/native/ in that repository.

The library itself is built on chiaki-ng (libchiaki, GNU AGPL-3.0 with OpenSSL exception) and FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1+).
Oyun Çeviri also reads CouchSubs' game pack format and follows ideas of CouchSubs and of GameTranslator by sefflex
(https://gitlab.com/sefflex/GameTranslator, a modified version of CouchSubs, GNU AGPL-3.0) for reading and filtering
subtitles and for installing the TV apps. Both are licensed under the GNU AGPL-3.0 like this project. Some game packs
come from these two projects (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).

Third-party components, models and game pack sources are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

